Package: rdpkg
Type: Package
Title: Read-Only Introspection of 'dpkg' and 'APT' State
Version: 0.0.1.2
Date: 2026-08-07
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Structured, read-only queries of installed-package state ('dpkg')
    and archive metadata ('APT'): installed packages, candidate versions,
    origins, and upgradeability, returned as plain data frames. Part of the
    Runix system-administration framework; mutations are out of scope and
    live in the 'rapt' package.
